{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/884832-how-to-orchestrate-a-surprise-party","id":884832,"title":"How to Orchestrate a surprise party?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-07T12:55:19-07:00","id":884832,"title":"How to Orchestrate a surprise party?","content":"was just thinking that I've never had, or been involved in a surprise party.<br /> <br /> Has anyone else here?<br /> <br /> it seems, along with helping a man find the, &quot;Perfect&quot; mood and setting for proposing, like something a changeling might get involved in.<br /> <br /> the suprise partys more a childling thing, the proposal, would be better done by a wilder maybe a grump.<br /> Just ideas on how they could help?<br /> <br /> Chicancery can help drape things in shadow.<br /> <br /> Dictum can convince their boss to give them the rest of the day off... any other ideas?<br /> oh you can use enchantment on friends, so they can have magic stuff explained to them.<br /> <br /> A boggan, obviously can do decoration, and cake baking, REALLY quickly.<br /> <br /> anything else","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-07-2016, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T07:18:55-07:00","id":885357,"title":"","content":"You could use Tale-Craft to create chimerical entertainment (shows, 'movies', storytelling). Sovereign 1/Protocol could establish the right mood and prevent fall outs. Satyrs could use the Gift of Pan to work everybody into a frenzy. The sluagh could lead a game of Chinese whispers...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T07:44:48-07:00","id":885372,"title":"","content":"well yes you could do that, I suppose, but am more interested in keeping the banal concerns that make surprise partys so rare IRL from intruding.<br /> <br /> e.g. school, work<br /> <br /> and getting things set up without giving oneself away.<br /> <br /> Starting to think doing this from the shadows, could be a reasonably good quest, or adventure for an entire motley.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.